{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dachs Hunter is a top-down roguelite game where you play as a dachshund wizard and must survive hordes of elemental monsters. Strategize as you discover and collect unique spells while mastering all elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/extras/gif_post2.gif?t=1744849673\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manual casting spells by default with a option to turn automatic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Casual 20 minutes runs plus boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collectable and upgradeable spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bosses with unique mechanics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/extras/frog_gif.gif?t=1744849673\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Some of the content available in early access:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">12 bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">50+ spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 playable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">100+ monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Friends Leaderboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and more..</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/extras/leaderboard_en.gif?t=1744849673\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3499910?t=1744849673","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744849673","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/3fa9956d9c5ae4df6993594be51a9fa0e5d241ad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744